   {
    "id": "chimoto-asagaya",
    "category": "eat",
    "name": {
     "en": "Chimoto Sōhonten Asagaya",
     "ja": "ちもと総本店 阿佐谷"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "A sweets house founded in the Edo period in what is now Ginza and based in Karuizawa since the war. This shop, opened in 2016, is its only other one: kakigōri made from natural ice, and the light Chimoto mochi.",
     "ja": "江戸時代に今の銀座界隈で創業し、戦後軽井沢に移った和菓子の老舗。2016年に開いた阿佐谷店は直営の二店目。天然氷のかき氷と、江戸時代から続く「ちもと餅」。"
    },
    "location": [
